  "body": "One Price. Two homes. Three generations. A lifetime of possibilities.\r\n\r\nBehind a private automatic gate, a rare opportunity in Macleans awaits - two beautifully different homes sharing one exceptional location, bringing together the charm of a classic single-level residence with the comfort of a contemporary new build.\r\n\r\nThese are homes designed around real family life. Bring your parents closer without giving up their independence. Give your children their own space as they grow. Welcome extended family, guests or even generate additional income, while everyone still has a place to call their own. Here, being together doesn't mean living on top of each other - it means being close enough to share the everyday moments that matter. \r\n\r\nWith separate power and water meters, the two homes offer genuine independence and flexibility, while providing an opportunity for two families to live together and potentially benefit from Macleans school zoning.\r\n\r\nAs you enter, a beautifully established garden creates a warm welcome. The front residence is a single-level solid-stone home with three bedrooms, a well-appointed bathroom, a separate lounge, and an open-plan kitchen and dining area. Recently refreshed with new paint and carpet, it feels clean, comfortable and ready for its next chapter. An internal-access garage adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nBeyond the front home, a second residence introduces a completely different experience. Recently built in a modern architectural style and also crafted in solid stone, it brings a fresh sense of space, light and contemporary living. Downstairs, the open-plan kitchen and dining area flows effortlessly through expansive tri-fold doors to a peaceful deck - a natural setting for morning coffee, family dinners or relaxed weekends together. A generous master bedroom with its own ensuite completes the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, sunlight fills the spacious second living area, opening onto a large balcony where elevated views create a beautiful backdrop to everyday life. A further generous bedroom and bathroom provide the flexibility needed for family, guests or independent living.\r\n\r\nThroughout the new home, thoughtful details elevate the experience, including underfloor heating, quality kitchen appliances and carefully selected contemporary bathroom fixtures. Every element has been chosen with comfort, practicality and modern family living in mind.\r\n\r\nSome properties give you more bedrooms. Some give you more living space. Very few give you the freedom to bring generations together while allowing everyone to retain their own space, privacy and independence.\r\n\r\nWhether your vision is a multi-generational family home, a place for your children to grow alongside grandparents, or a property with genuine income potential, this is a rare opportunity to create something truly special in the heart of Macleans.\r\n\r\n* Find more properties you may like at - https://www.teamvishrealestate.co.nz/",
